<title>SPAIN: FORECAST-Fenosa net seen up 16.1 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Fenosa net seen up 16.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish electricity firm Union Fenosa. Simple averages of analysts forecasts. In billion of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Operating income	350.67     346.92    374.01-322.83</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 21.75	18.73     22.80- 19.50</p>
<p>Contributors: AB Asesores, BBV interactivos, ABN-Amro, Ahorro Corporacion, Benito y Monjardin, Beta Capital, Credit Lyonnais, Ibersecurities.</p>
<p>Union Fenosa has yet to set a date to release its results.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
